OL,3,GNEWSATen-year-old Willow among children
OL,4,Ato benefit from pioneering same-day
OL,5,Atest to spot infections
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pioneering same-day test has been
OL,8,Fused to detect hidden and
OL,9,Fdrug-resistant infections among
OL,10,Fchildren in intensive care.
OL,12,FRespiratory samples from more than 100
OL,13,Fcritically ill young patients at
OL,14,FLondon's Great Ormond Street Hospital
OL,15,F(GOSH) were sent for what is known as
OL,16,Fmetagenomic testing.
OL,18,FIt can identify bacteria, viruses and
OL,19,Ffungi from a single sample, which in
OL,20,Fmany cases influences what doctors
OL,21,Fprescribe.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
